:ComplexActionType           rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual .
:CAPECPattern                rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual .
:ATTCKTactic                 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual .
:ATTCKTechnique              rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual .
:SupportingAssetType         rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual .
:HumanResource               rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual .
:D3FENDArtifact              rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual .
